messages.content:
Classify this Vapi booking availability request.

Current time in Make:
{{now}}
Default timezone:
Australia/Sydney

booking_intent_text:
{{ifempty(get(1.message.toolCallList; 1) + .arguments.booking_intent_text; ifempty(1.booking_intent_text; ""))}}

preferred_date_text:
{{ifempty(get(1.message.toolCallList; 1) + .arguments.preferred_date_text; ifempty(1.preferred_date_text; ""))}}

search_reason:
{{ifempty(get(1.message.toolCallList; 1) + .arguments.search_reason; ifempty(1.search_reason; ""))}}

caller_context:
{{ifempty(get(1.message.toolCallList; 1) + .arguments.caller_context; ifempty(1.caller_context; ""))}}

Return only the strict JSON object requested in the system instructions.

mapper.body:
{
  "results": [
    {
      "toolCallId": "{{get(1.message.toolCallList; 1).id}}",
      "result": {
        "success": false,
        "needs_clarification": true,
        "message": "The booking type or call mode is unclear. Ask the caller a short clarification question before booking the appointment.",
        "clarification_question": "{{2.result.clarification_question}}",
        "allowed_booking_types": [
          "Discovery Call",
          "Strategy Session (Phone)",
          "Strategy Session (Zoom)",
          "Initial Finance Consult (Phone)",
          "Initial Finance Consult (Zoom)"
        ],
        "classifier_intent_index": "{{2.result.intent_index}}",
        "classifier_intent_label": "{{2.result.intent_label}}",
        "classifier_confidence": "{{2.result.confidence}}",
        "classifier_needs_clarification": "{{2.result.needs_clarification}}",
        "classifier_clarification_question": "{{2.result.clarification_question}}",
        "classifier_routing_reason": "{{2.result.routing_reason}}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
